  knownFacts:
  - "T\xFCccar tap\u0131na\u011Fa kupas\u0131n\u0131 b\u0131rakmak i\xE7in geldi."
  - "Ge\xE7 saatte tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131 kilitledim."
