  - "N\xF6bette uyuklad\u0131m, ger\xE7ek olay\u0131 g\xF6rmedim."
  mandatoryFinalFact: "T\xFCccar\u0131n o\u011Flunu o gece i\xE7eri ben ald\u0131m."
